<title>USA: Advanced Micro Devices to cut 250 jobs.</title>
<headline>Advanced Micro Devices to cut 250 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Micro Devices Inc said it will cut about 250 jobs from its worldwide staff of 12,400.</p>
<p>It said the action was needed to &quot;reduce its fundamental cost structure and to align skill sets with anticipated future needs.&quot;</p>
<p>The company will take a charge of &quot;up to $8 million,&quot; to cover the costs of providing benefits to the employees being laid off.</p>
</text>
